<title>POLAND: OKOCIM TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 19.4.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 19.4.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 89,000 shares in Okocim SA at 19.4 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Okocim was trading at 18.7 zlotys in 49,013 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
